prompt_text:
An ultra-cute pink Japanese anime character reference collage for a princess idol named "[シャソリア]", styled like a dense hand-sketched scrapbook page filled with hearts, lace, ribbons, plush toys, and handwritten notes.

Style & Medium: Shoujo manga aesthetic, delicate rose-pink monochrome pen line art with soft watercolor shading, rosy gradients, and a slightly cluttered hand-drawn concept sheet layout on a pale blush-pink textured paper background.

Main Subject: A kawaii princess idol girl with [cotton-candy pink] long twin-tail hair, large sparkling pink eyes, frilly lace dress, heart tiara, rose hair accessories, pearl garlands, bows, ruffled socks, and heart Mary Jane shoes. She looks sweet, shy, fluffy, and doll-like.

Composition & Layout (3:4 vertical):
A crowded character sheet featuring exactly 9 visible depictions of the same character:
1. A large seated full-body illustration on the right holding a plush bunny (primary focal point);
2. A large left-side close-up portrait with an ornate heart tiara and roses, partially covered by an opaque pastel pink square placeholder;
3. A sleeping chibi face in the top-right corner;
4. A small chibi face at the lower left with puffy sleeves;
5. A small neutral chibi head near the lower middle;
6. A happy laughing head at the bottom center;
7. A tiny full-body chibi at the bottom right;
8. A peeking half-body character emerging from the left edge;
9. A small shy face portrait near the center-left.

Text & Annotations: Decorative handwritten Japanese text in pink ink, featuring a large bubbly title reading "[シャソリア]" at top-left, speech bubbles, and cloud-shaped note boxes with phrases: 「すきらきらおひめさま!!♡」, 「しくすさんもだいすき♡」, 「ふわふわのリボンテールさいこーっ♡」, 「かわいすぎ!!! 天才…!? 尊い(;_;)♡」, 「すきなもの うさちゃん、くまさん、いちご、リボン おひめさまっ…!!」, 「ゆめ みんなをしあわせにするアイドルになるっ…♡」, 「ぴんくがいちばんしあわせ♡」, 「リほんいっぱいだいすき!」, and 「お姫さまになりたいの…♡」.

Decorative Details: Exactly 6 plush mascots (teddy bear at top-center, bunny at top-right, bunny plush held by the main girl, small teddy near the bottom note, small bunny near the heart name balloon, tiny animal hair clip). Scattered doodles of stars, ribbons, lace borders, dangling charms, a heart balloon, a mini cupcake, and tiny crowns.

Color Palette: Predominantly blush pink, rose pink, and cream white. No dark outlines, no realistic 3D rendering, no modern UI elements.

